show "=== Design session contract ==="

remember a string called source-state with "scanned"
remember a string called claim-basis with "document"
remember a string called convergence with "open"
remember a list called design-decisions with "none"
remember a list called tradeoffs-considered with "none"
remember a list called open-questions with "none"
remember a number called lock-count with 0

remember how to disclose from status: show status

when convergence is equal to "locked"
  show "OK: design converged — proceed to implementation"

when claim-basis is equal to "inference" unless source-state is equal to "verified"
  show "WARNING: design claim is inferred, not verified against source"

when source-state is equal to "unscanned"
  show "HOLD: scan prior art before proposing design"

show "--- recording design decisions ---"
add "decision-three-layer-architecture" to design-decisions
add "decision-bounded-vocabulary" to design-decisions
add "decision-tiered-operation" to design-decisions

add "tradeoff-flexibility-vs-precision" to tradeoffs-considered
add "tradeoff-skill-size-vs-coverage" to tradeoffs-considered

add "question-pack-versioning-strategy" to open-questions

show design-decisions
show tradeoffs-considered
show open-questions

show "--- routing on convergence ---"
choose if convergence is equal to "locked": show "ship the design" otherwise show "continue iterating"

disclose from claim-basis
count design-decisions
